 + 1 > best_w:\n            print(f'Counterexample! n={n}, rad={rad}, best_w={best_w}')\n            found_counterexample = True\n            break\n    if found_counterexample:\n        break\n\nif not found_counterexample:\n    print('Verified: radius + 1 <= gamma_R(G) for all connected graphs up to n=7!')\n\"","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Verifying conjecture on graph atlas","toolSummary":"Verify conjecture on atlas with python"}}]}
